"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-22T22:15:09Z","updated_at":"2025-03-22T22:15:09Z","body":"Can this fix issue #103345?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2745892564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2745906621","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104485#issuecomment-2745906621","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104485","id":2745906621,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jqzW9","user":{"login":"EricEzaM","id":41730826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzMwODI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41730826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM","html_url":"https://github.com/EricEzaM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-22T23:03:43Z","updated_at":"2025-03-22T23:06:12Z","body":"@beicause unfortunately that is a little bit more complex. Not sure if it can be solved easily, let me explain:\r\n\r\nWhen a shortcut input is made, **all** `EditorProperty` instances receive it via `shortcut_input`, then they themselves determine if they should activate if `selected == true`.\r\n\r\nWhen sub-insepctors are used, it appears that only the `root` inspector is what has the Viewport `gui_focus`, even if you click into a sub-inspector. That is why in this PR we get the `root_inspector`, since it is what will have focus. It means that essentially multiple `EditorProperty` instances have `selected == true` and receive the input (since they are in the shortcut context), so they will all execute their logic. Possible fixes off the top of my head:\r\n- Allow sub-inspectors to have `gui_focus`, then `EditorProperty` could set the shortcut context to `get_parent_inspector()` rather than `get_parent_inspector()->get_root_inspector()`\r\n- When a property is selected, go to the root inspector and recursively deselect all other properties. That way only 1 property in the whole inspector can be selected at a time, and thus only 1 will process shortcuts.\r\n\r\nIf one of these changes is desired it may be best off in a different PR, to keep them small.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2745906621/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767434606","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104485#issuecomment-2767434606","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104485","id":2767434606,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k87Nu","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T21:25:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T21:25:10Z","body":"The new algorithm seems to be more complex, involving sorting. I'm a bit worried about performance impact. Although for shortcut input maybe it won't make difference.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767434606/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769160728","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104485#issuecomment-2769160728","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104485","id":2769160728,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lDgoY","user":{"login":"EricEzaM","id":41730826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzMwODI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41730826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM","html_url":"https://github.com/EricEzaM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T12:13:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T12:13:48Z","body":"> The new algorithm seems to be more complex, involving sorting. I'm a bit worried about performance impact. Although for shortcut input maybe it won't make difference.\r\n\r\nOn my PC, the addition of this sorting makes the processing of such inputs about 5 times slower, 0.05ms -> 0.25ms, on an input which has no effect (e.g. pressing ctrl). This is only triggered when the keyboard/joypad input is not handled by a control directly (which is most 'release' events).\r\n\r\nAs I said in the OP this is optional. It _may_ make the base case better in _some scenarios_. Honestly it doesn't seem worth it to me. The advice should always be to properly set the shortcut context and try not to have conflicting global shortcuts.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769160728/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769168446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104485#issuecomment-2769168446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104485","id":2769168446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lDig-","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T12:16:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T12:16:48Z","body":"If the inspector changes are enough to fix the linked issues, you should split the SceneTree changes into separate PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769168446/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issue